{
  "name": "fairbooks-vendor-tax-forms",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairbooks-vendor-tax-forms",
  "description": "Fairbooks Vendor Tax Forms: an MCP agent that tracks vendor W-9 and W-8 readiness from CSV exports (missing, unsigned or expired forms, TIN format and pattern per entity type, always masked), finds duplicate vendor records, summarises 1099 readiness against a threshold you set, and drafts request emails. Sends are one human click; it never files with the IRS and is not tax advice.",
